  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CCM,Destr.illegala vapen</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCM,Destruction of weapon - CCM,TAE 1999-2000</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Moc kristna r&#xE5;d (CCM) bedriver opinionsbildn och samlar in och f&#xF6;rst&#xF6;rillegala vapen. I utbyte f&#xE5;r de som &#xF6;verl&#xE4;mnar vapen en vara, som kan fr&#xE4;mja ekonomisk verksamhet, ex verktyg,cykel,symaskin etc. Sedan projektet startade 1995 har ca 3 000 vapen och en stor m&#xE4;ngd ammuni tion samlats in och f&#xF6;rst&#xF6;rts.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Christian Council of MOZ collects and destrois illegal weapons. Useful goods such as tools, bicycles, sewing machine etc is given as agratification to the person(s) handing over weapons.Since 1995 the project has received 3 000 weapons and a large quantity of ammunition andexplosives that has been destroyed.</narrative>
  </description>
